# Copy to .env.local and adjust. NEVER put any secret here — this app only
# holds PUBLIC keys (Supabase anon key is safe by design: the schema grants
# `anon` zero privileges; everything the portal reads goes through the
# tenant_* Edge Functions with the user's session JWT).
#
# Local stack (supabase start + tests/serve_local.ts on 54431):
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54421
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<anon key from `supabase status`>
NEXT_PUBLIC_FUNCTIONS_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54431/functions/v1
# Hosted:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://<your-project-ref>.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<project anon key>
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FUNCTIONS_URL=https://<your-project-ref>.supabase.co/functions/v1
